# Optional. Without it the tailscale container prints a login URL in its logs
# (`docker compose logs tailscale`); approve it, then tag the node
# (tag:prometheus) and disable key expiry in the admin console. With it: a
# tagged, non-reusable auth key from https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys.
# Only needed on first start; the identity then lives in /opt/prometheus/ts-state.
TS_AUTHKEY=
